{"metadata":{"name":"Jami At Tirmidhi","name_native":"جامع الترمذي","section":{"43":"Chapters on Manners"},"section_detail":{"43":{"hadithnumber_first":2736,"hadithnumber_last":2858,"arabicnumber_first":2736,"arabicnumber_last":2858,"name_native":"كتاب الأدب"}}},"hadiths":[{"hadithnumber":2855,"arabicnumber":2855,"text":"حدثنا محمود بن غيلان، حدثنا ابو احمد، حدثنا سفيان، عن الاعمش، عن ابي وايل، عن عبد الله، قال كان رسول الله صلى الله عليه وسلم يتخولنا بالموعظة في الايام مخافة السامة علينا . قال ابو عيسى هذا حديث حسن صحيح","grades":[{"name":"Al-Albani","grade":"Sahih"},{"name":"Bashar Awad Maarouf","grade":"Hasan Sahih"},{"name":"Zubair Ali Zai","grade":"Sahih - Agreed Upon"}],"reference":{"book":43,"hadith":130}},{"hadithnumber":2855.2,"arabicnumber":2855.2,"text":"","grades":[{"name":"Al-Albani","grade":"Sahih"},{"name":"Bashar Awad Maarouf","grade":"Hasan Sahih"}],"reference":{"book":43,"hadith":131}}]}